From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SpreadZhao <spreadzhao@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:18:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] bar/status-bar: add native status bar

Render a native status bar on every output with configurable fonts and
padding, and read complete newline-delimited status lines from standard
input.

The drawing helper retains its upstream license and attribution in drwl.h.
---
